      "en": "even three thousand talents of gold, of the gold of Ophir, and seven thousand talents of refined silver, with which to overlay the walls of the houses;",
      "ko": "곧 오빌의 금 삼천 달란트와 천은 칠천 달란트라 모든 전 벽에 입히며",
      "source_text_hash": "8b19e2c42d88191fece5044a2ea4b8695f2c396a57f3e61998ebce7fe50fd020",
      "translation_text_hash": "2c2e5819c45162be42ff2cc0a76d4c37215cf7fe95ab3182bd458888ef3b0977",
