      "en": "Then the princes of the fathers’ households, and the princes of the tribes of Israel, and the captains of thousands and of hundreds, with the rulers over the king’s work, offered willingly;",
      "ko": "이에 모든 족장과 이스라엘 모든 지파 어른과 천부장과 백부장과 왕의 사무감독이 다 즐거이 드리되",
      "source_text_hash": "70e0fb3e08a06a0bcccb2e5917130250733f1460c8bff1126b8a6a794ae52720",
      "translation_text_hash": "0fb70c6126eacd7d0f4f7cbe37181c6eb38339ea194121cdd3bcd300d31291f0",
