      "en": "and they gave for the service of God’s house of gold five thousand talents and ten thousand darics, of silver ten thousand talents, of bronze eighteen thousand talents, and of iron one hundred thousand talents.",
      "ko": "하나님의 전 역사를 위하여 금 오천 달란트와 금 다릭 일만과 은 일만 달란트와 놋 일만 팔천 달란트와 철 십만 달란트를 드리고",
      "source_text_hash": "642dd365d4f07248dfbd3912e899f2ebf857f83e64c55f7fa1983fb7d5e76d46",
      "translation_text_hash": "6867a963290bd4e170d284a8de8fbf72161cf7d75e2c94521985add932e47e70",
