      "en": "People with whom precious stones were found gave them to the treasure of the LORD’s house, under the hand of Jehiel the Gershonite.",
      "ko": "무릇 보석이 있는 자는 게르손 사람 여히엘의 손에 부쳐 여호와의 전 곳간에 드렸더라",
      "source_text_hash": "091f4caf1256c6a6a502203553e86701122ec04ae6408e13b428bc6523eca921",
      "translation_text_hash": "5505ce1a95726881ab2c2b780d18d74c518d6de10fe4b579984d2d836183f18d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
